# Design system

Source of truth: `docs/DESIGN.md`. Values: `client/lib/design/tokens.cjs`. CSS vars: `client/global.css`. Tailwind: `client/tailwind.config.js`.

## Forbidden in app/ and components/ui

- `text-[20px]`, `min-h-[44px]`, `h-24`, `leading-10`, any `-[…px]`
- Hex (`#C8F54A`) and `fontFamily`
- `text-base`, `text-xl`, `text-2xl`, `rounded-xl`, `p-5` (not on our scale)
- `style={{ fontSize, color, padding, margin }}` for visuals

Need a new size? Add it to `tokens.cjs` first.

## Type (prefer type-*)

`type-caption` / `text-xs` = 13. `type-body` / `text-sm` = 16. `type-title` / `text-md` = 20. `type-display` / `text-lg` = 32 (Home total only). `type-label` = caption + medium. `type-amount` = `tabular-nums`.

CTA = `bg-lime` + `text-ink`. Paid `success`, failed `danger`, unknown `warning`.

Space: keys `0 1 2 3 4 6 8 12` only. Radius `sm md lg full`. Hit target `min-h-tap`. Disabled `opacity-disabled`.

Tab bar / lucide: `chrome(scheme)` and `icon` from `lib/design/tokens.ts`.

Primitives: Button, Card, Input, Screen, StatusBadge, EmptyState, ErrorState, ScreenSkeleton.

Copy is locked in `docs/DESIGN.md`. No Figma. No second font or icon pack.
